  "update_count": 70,
  "description_snippet": "**VULNERABILITY DETAILS**   \n  \nWhen making a search to |completed_fetches_|, there is no check whether the query result is |end()|[1]. And the fetch-item could also be erased at [2]. So the race makes the HeapOverflow happen. (Asan may throw it out as UAF）  \n  \n[1]. https://source.chromium.org/chro"
}